          "ontomedia:description": "Local café owner and gossip hub, though sometimes too involved in others' lives",
          "ontomedia:background": "Former Copenhagen resident who moved to Ærø fifteen years ago after a difficult divorce. Found peace and purpose in the island's slower pace of life. Opened her café eight years ago, which has become a community hub.",
