          "ontomedia:age": 29,
          "ontomedia:description": "Traditional island doctor with deep roots in the community, though sometimes too rigid in her beliefs",
          "ontomedia:background": "Born and raised on Ærø, childhood friend of Mads. Left for medical school in Copenhagen but maintained strong ties to the island. Recently returned to take over her father's practice after his retirement. Known for her traditional approach to medicine and deep understanding of island healing practices.",
